### Crear una activación
POST http://localhost:3000/activations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-1122",
  "planId": "FLOW-FULL"
}

### Consultar una activación (pegá el activationId que te devolvió el POST)
GET http://localhost:3000/activations/act-b9addb40

### Escenario 2: fallo en provisioning (con compensación)
POST http://localhost:3000/activations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-2002",
  "planId": "FLOW-FULL",
  "simulateFailure": "provisioning"
}

### Fallo en billing
POST http://localhost:3000/activations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-3003",
  "planId": "FLOW-FULL",
  "simulateFailure": "billing"
}